  "claim_boundary": "This boundary records corrected core AlphaEvolve requirement anchors with verified module, test, sidecar, and TODO links and connects them to the PDF-verified named source inventory, bounded 50-requirement Table 1/Section 2 inventory, and bounded 41-claim Abstract, Introduction, Discussion, and collaborator-context inventory, plus the bounded 41-claim Section 3.1, Table 2, Figure 4, and footnote 3 matrix-result inventory, and the bounded 63-claim Section 3.2 and Figure 5 constructive-math inventory, plus the bounded 45-claim Section 3.3 opening, Section 3.3.1, and Figure 6 scheduling inventory, plus the bounded 59-claim Section 3.3.2 and Figure 7 kernel-engineering inventory, plus the bounded 35-claim Section 3.3.3 hardware-circuit-design inventory, plus the bounded 44-claim Section 3.3.4 compiler-generated-code inventory, plus the bounded 51-claim Section 4 and Figure 8 ablation inventory, plus the bounded 85-claim Section 5 Related Work inventory, which separates 59 source-context-only claims from 26 implementation-relevant claims, plus the bounded 131-claim Appendix A, Table 3, and Figure 9 inventory, plus the bounded 188-claim Appendix B and Figures 10-14 inventory across all 13 subsections, plus lexical linkage for 195 TeX citation uses, 240 citation-key links, and all 120 compiled references, plus construct-level disposition for all 30 retained-source captions, displayed equations, and semantic footnotes, plus row- and cell-level disposition for all 83 rows and 240 cells in Tables 1-3, with all 78 data rows mapped to 78 existing bounded claims and zero new claims, plus environment- and line-level disposition for all 8 retained TeX code listing environments and all 305 physical source lines, with 214 bounded-claim-component lines mapped to 60 existing claims and zero new or unmapped lines. It does not establish whole-paper proposition-level semantic exhaustiveness and does not classify citation semantics, source sufficiency, or implementation relevance. It does not claim a whole-paper exhaustive requirement inventory or whole-paper claim-level source-span coverage matrix, paper-index phrase evidence-link sufficiency, status-cell semantic verifier, implemented benchmark bullet semantic verifier, absence-sentence freshness matrix, module coverage detector, test/runtime-artifact coverage detector, generated code-audit report, CI exhaustiveness gate, or proof that every AlphaEvolve-facing implementation claim has been classified."
